sentences.text:
7. Let the applicant- Girraj, involved in the aforesaid case, be released on bail on his furnishing a personal bond and two heavy sureties each in the like amount to the satisfaction of Court concerned subject to the conditions that he:
1. shall appear on the date fixed by the trial court;
2. shall not tamper with the prosecution evidence;
3. shall not pressurize the prosecution witnesses; and,
4. shall not leave the district without prior permission of the trial court.
8. In case of breach of any of the above conditions, the prosecution shall be at liberty to move bail cancellation application before this Court.

